p:noctua-nh-d15 a rt:Cooling ;
    rdfs:label "Noctua NH-D15" ;
    rdfs:comment "Flagship dual-tower air cooler renowned for matching AIO liquid cooler performance while remaining virtually silent. The dual NF-A15 140mm fans and six heatpipe design handle up to 250W TDP. At 165mm tall it fits most mid-tower cases but will be tight in compact builds. Compatible with both AM5 and LGA 1700 sockets via the included mounting kits." ;
