    rdfs:label "Corsair iCUE H100i Elite 240mm AIO" ;
    rdfs:comment "240mm all-in-one liquid cooler with magnetic dome pump head and two SP120 RGB Elite fans. Delivers excellent cooling for high-TDP processors while keeping noise levels low. The 240mm radiator handles up to 200W sustained load comfortably. At 55mm radiator thickness plus 25mm fan height it requires less vertical clearance than tall air coolers, making it a good fit for compact cases with top-mount radiator support. Compatible with AM5 and LGA 1700 sockets." ;
